WEBVTT

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.120
So! Our latest attempt to stomp out
powerful tians has failed.

00:00:13.120 --> 00:00:15.660
I'd say our strategy had a few holes.

00:00:15.660 --> 00:00:20.160
The original plan had us giving
the little sister poisoned remberries

00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:22.290
with which to kill her big sister,

00:00:22.290 --> 00:00:25.870
but for some reason, all the remberries
had vanished from the shops.

00:00:25.870 --> 00:00:29.580
We ended up having to send in
some Demi-Drag-Worms instead.

00:00:29.580 --> 00:00:33.450
The chief issue here is that our
back-up plan was <i>also</i> foiled.

00:00:33.450 --> 00:00:37.950
That bear is strong, all right!
He took on nearly a hundred Demi-Drags!

00:00:37.950 --> 00:00:40.410
<i>I</i> could handle <i>that</i> much.

00:00:40.410 --> 00:00:44.830
But for a jobless level-0
to defeat a Demi-Drag-Worm...

00:00:44.830 --> 00:00:47.370
...I've never heard of such a ridiculous feat.

00:00:47.370 --> 00:00:53.500
Dear me! So it's not the bear that has you
on edge, General--it's the rank beginner?

00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:55.500
I look forward to wiping him out.

00:00:55.500 --> 00:00:59.870
King of Beasts, you've been quiet
all this time. Anything to add?

00:00:59.870 --> 00:01:02.500
The bear was really cute.

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:07.040
I'll never understand your taste, King.

00:02:37.700 --> 00:02:41.950
Here's to Ray's arrival
and his first quest cleared!

00:02:37.700 --> 00:02:41.950
"Chapter 2: 
Tomb Labyrinth"

00:02:41.950 --> 00:02:43.870
Cheers, grizz!

00:02:43.870 --> 00:02:46.500
Now eat up.

00:02:47.870 --> 00:02:49.200
Delicious!

00:02:49.200 --> 00:02:52.410
The owner here is the
top-class Star Chef, grizz.

00:02:52.410 --> 00:02:55.160
Like a three-star chef in the real world.

00:02:55.370 --> 00:03:01.290
"Hungry"

00:02:56.660 --> 00:02:57.950
"Hungry"?

00:02:57.950 --> 00:03:01.290
You'll get updates if anything happens IRL.

00:03:01.290 --> 00:03:04.700
Oh, okay. Let me just log out for a sec.

00:03:04.700 --> 00:03:08.950
What?! But I can't eat without you here, Master!

00:03:08.950 --> 00:03:12.160
Okay, okay. I'll be right back.

00:03:19.540 --> 00:03:23.200
It's true: Only one-third of
all that time really passed.

00:03:23.200 --> 00:03:26.500
Well, I better take care of business.

00:03:27.580 --> 00:03:30.410
"Save Points"
"Royal Capital Altea"
"Tri-Star Restaurant"

00:03:30.700 --> 00:03:32.870
Welcome back, grizz!

00:03:35.040 --> 00:03:37.660
I was really looking forward to that!

00:03:37.660 --> 00:03:40.500
Worry not, grizz.

00:03:40.500 --> 00:03:43.000
Time for round two, grizz!

00:03:43.000 --> 00:03:47.790
Hey, bro, Embryos change shape
as they evolve, right?

00:03:47.790 --> 00:03:50.450
Will my Nemesis change out of this human form?

00:03:50.450 --> 00:03:55.910
Evolution style is all up to the Master,
but Nemesis will probably always be a Maiden.

00:03:55.910 --> 00:03:59.290
Though the Arms portion might
evolve into a different type,

00:03:59.290 --> 00:04:04.000
Maiden is already a hybrid--
a mixture of multiple types.

00:04:04.000 --> 00:04:06.330
Huh! I might have hit the jackpot.

00:04:06.330 --> 00:04:08.790
Oh, and <i>I'm</i> the jackpot?!

00:04:10.370 --> 00:04:13.330
I know someone with a Maiden Embryo--
her secondary type changed

00:04:13.330 --> 00:04:15.620
in lots of different ways.

00:04:15.620 --> 00:04:18.790
Now she's a Superior Embryo.

00:04:18.790 --> 00:04:20.410
A Superior Embryo?

00:04:20.410 --> 00:04:23.700
A first- to third-form Embryo is low-rank.

00:04:23.700 --> 00:04:25.910
From fourth- to sixth form, it's high-rank.

00:04:25.910 --> 00:04:31.790
And at its seventh and ultimate form,
it's a Superior Embryo.

00:04:31.790 --> 00:04:35.500
So-called because it's surpassed
the limits of the highest rank.

00:04:35.500 --> 00:04:39.540
Final form... A Superior Embryo...

00:04:39.540 --> 00:04:44.330
Fewer than a hundred players
have reached that point, though.

00:04:44.330 --> 00:04:47.370
How far has your Embryo evolved?

00:04:47.370 --> 00:04:49.500
That's a secret, grizz.

00:04:49.500 --> 00:04:51.620
Nom.

00:04:51.620 --> 00:04:55.950
Hey, do you and Liliana
have a past or something?

00:04:55.950 --> 00:04:58.660
It totally looked like she knew you.

00:04:58.660 --> 00:05:01.160
Grizz...

00:05:01.160 --> 00:05:03.950
Don't tell me you did something.

00:05:03.950 --> 00:05:07.160
She resents me because I <i>didn't</i> do something.

00:05:07.160 --> 00:05:09.830
Huh? What's that mean?

00:05:09.830 --> 00:05:11.750
Six months back in <i>Dendro</i> time,

00:05:11.750 --> 00:05:16.250
Dryfe Imperium, land of machines,
waged a war of aggression on the Altar Kingdom.

00:05:16.250 --> 00:05:18.870
The Altar Kingdom lost that war.

00:05:18.870 --> 00:05:21.290
With it, they lost a third of their territory;

00:05:21.290 --> 00:05:24.120
from their tians, they lost the Arch
Sage and half their knights...

00:05:24.120 --> 00:05:26.620
...along with their king.

00:05:26.620 --> 00:05:28.910
Is Dryfe that powerful?

00:05:28.910 --> 00:05:32.040
No, the two countries were
evenly matched in might.

00:05:32.040 --> 00:05:35.750
It's just that most of Altar's
Masters didn't participate.

00:05:35.750 --> 00:05:36.500
Huh?

00:05:36.500 --> 00:05:41.120
Because the king had this idea
not to give out prizes.

00:05:41.120 --> 00:05:45.250
The opposing Dryfe had set
clear prize standards.

00:05:45.250 --> 00:05:51.160
But the real nail in Altar's coffin was
their Big Three sitting out the war.

00:05:51.160 --> 00:05:55.620
King of Destruction, real name unknown,
at the top of the kill rankings.

00:05:55.620 --> 00:05:59.450
Over Gladiator Figaro,
at the top of the duel rankings.

00:05:59.450 --> 00:06:05.700
High Priestess Tsukiyo Fuso, owner of the Moon
Society clan at the top of the clan rankings.

00:06:05.700 --> 00:06:11.120
Since the top players in each
rank didn't take part,

00:06:11.120 --> 00:06:14.200
neither did most of the other ranking players.

00:06:14.200 --> 00:06:19.410
And only those listed ranking players
and clans <i>could</i> participate.

00:06:19.410 --> 00:06:20.950
Huh...

00:06:20.950 --> 00:06:26.660
But Dryfe's top three--they were there.
Altar was practically trampled.

00:06:26.660 --> 00:06:30.500
The kingdom was headed
straight for total ruination

00:06:30.500 --> 00:06:37.580
when Dryfe's neighbor Caldina invaded
them mid-war, and Dryfe withdrew from Altar.

00:06:37.580 --> 00:06:40.700
And Liliana resents you because...

00:06:40.700 --> 00:06:45.870
Because I'm one of the ranking
members who didn't take part.

00:06:45.870 --> 00:06:51.000
And the last Knight commander,
who died in the war, was Liliana's father.

00:06:51.000 --> 00:06:54.660
Huh? Jeez! Why didn't you fight?

00:06:54.660 --> 00:06:58.040
With me, broken gear means a blown cover.

00:06:58.040 --> 00:06:59.620
What?

00:06:59.620 --> 00:07:03.290
No way... You kept your
default real-world looks?!

00:07:03.290 --> 00:07:05.790
Whoopsie, grizz.

00:07:05.790 --> 00:07:08.700
Yeah, in your case, that <i>would</i> be pretty bad.

00:07:08.700 --> 00:07:12.160
I've changed my equipment since--
I'll be in the next one.

00:07:12.160 --> 00:07:14.660
Will Dryfe attack again?

00:07:14.660 --> 00:07:19.950
Yeah. They're beefing themselves up
while we're getting weaker.

00:07:19.950 --> 00:07:21.950
It'll be one tough fight.

00:07:21.950 --> 00:07:23.410
Getting weaker?

00:07:23.410 --> 00:07:27.200
Lots of players immigrated
to other lands after Altar lost.

00:07:27.200 --> 00:07:29.580
Shuffled 70% of the rankings, too.

00:07:29.580 --> 00:07:30.950
Hmm.

00:07:30.950 --> 00:07:34.200
This might just be my chance
to make the rankings, then.

00:07:34.200 --> 00:07:36.580
So you've found yourself a new goal?

00:07:36.580 --> 00:07:41.540
Yep! I'm going to level up
and become a ranking player!

00:07:41.540 --> 00:07:45.870
Then you'll want to get your gear
in order and find yourself a job.

00:07:48.330 --> 00:07:49.870
You okay for weapons, grizz?

00:07:49.870 --> 00:07:52.330
Yeah. Nemesis'll do as a weapon.

00:07:52.330 --> 00:07:54.830
"Nemesis'll do"?! No, sir!

00:07:54.830 --> 00:07:57.950
I think you mean "Nemesis is the best around"!

00:07:57.950 --> 00:08:00.660
Nemesis is the best around.

00:08:00.660 --> 00:08:02.160
Ugh, monotone much?

00:08:02.160 --> 00:08:04.830
Then next you'll need a job, grizz!

00:08:04.830 --> 00:08:07.910
<i>The Suitable Job Diagnostics Catalog</i> !

00:08:07.910 --> 00:08:11.950
Read that to find the most suitable job
available to you now, grizz!

00:08:11.950 --> 00:08:14.830
Now that's handy!

00:08:14.830 --> 00:08:17.580
Let's see what I got.

00:08:17.580 --> 00:08:18.700
Huh?

00:08:18.700 --> 00:08:19.950
Paladin.

00:08:19.950 --> 00:08:24.870
That's odd. Usually you can't become
a high-rank Paladin so early on.

00:08:24.870 --> 00:08:26.120
That's high-rank?

00:08:26.120 --> 00:08:30.950
You've got your low-rank,
high-rank, and Superior jobs.

00:08:30.950 --> 00:08:33.450
So jobs can be Superior, too.

00:08:33.450 --> 00:08:37.540
Only one person can hold
the Superior rank for each job--

00:08:37.540 --> 00:08:39.620
and the requirements are pretty strict.

00:08:39.620 --> 00:08:41.910
What are the requirements for a Paladin?

00:08:41.910 --> 00:08:46.950
Defeat at least 50% of Demi-Dragon-class
boss monsters yourself.

00:08:46.950 --> 00:08:48.660
Demi-Dragon-class, huh?

00:08:48.660 --> 00:08:50.370
You can fight those rotten centipedes.

00:08:50.370 --> 00:08:51.040
Yeah!

00:08:51.040 --> 00:08:53.910
And donate 200 thousand lir to the church.

00:08:53.910 --> 00:08:57.250
If I sell my items, I should have
more than 400 thousand lir!

00:08:57.250 --> 00:09:01.290
Finally, get a recommendation from
a key Knight or related figure.

00:09:01.290 --> 00:09:04.370
Hmm... That I don't have.

00:09:04.370 --> 00:09:08.830
No: You got something very much <i>like</i>
a recommendation yesterday.

00:09:08.830 --> 00:09:13.080
Aha! So <i>that</i> was the main reward
from yesterday's quest!

00:09:13.080 --> 00:09:14.160
Huh?

00:09:24.830 --> 00:09:28.330
"Obtained Recommendation from Liliana"

00:09:31.870 --> 00:09:33.370
"Donated 200,000 Lir to the Church"

00:09:37.370 --> 00:09:39.410
Thanks for everything, big bro.

00:09:39.410 --> 00:09:42.000
Sure! Good luck on your own from here on out.

00:09:42.000 --> 00:09:44.120
On his own? <i>I'm</i> here.

00:09:44.120 --> 00:09:47.040
But if you get really stuck, let me know, grizz.

00:09:47.040 --> 00:09:48.250
Will do!

00:09:49.290 --> 00:09:51.910
Bearwell, grizz!

00:09:52.870 --> 00:09:57.000
I'm so looking forward
to leveling you up, Master!

00:09:58.660 --> 00:10:01.450
This night I thirst for blood!

00:10:01.450 --> 00:10:05.330
It's... It's still light out.

00:10:05.330 --> 00:10:07.200
Hah!

00:10:09.870 --> 00:10:13.540
That's a high-rank job for you!
I'm practically invincible around here!

00:10:13.540 --> 00:10:16.120
You've gained three levels
and learned some skills, too.

00:10:16.120 --> 00:10:18.790
That recovery magic is huge!

00:10:24.330 --> 00:10:27.830
Hmm. Looks like those two are struggling.

00:10:27.830 --> 00:10:33.000
It sure does. It'd be rude to just
barge in with an assist... I know!

00:10:33.000 --> 00:10:34.580
First Heal!

00:10:37.290 --> 00:10:38.580
Much appreciated!

00:10:38.580 --> 00:10:40.200
Thank you!

00:10:51.540 --> 00:10:53.120
First Heal!

00:10:56.660 --> 00:10:58.500
Thank you for healing us!

00:10:58.500 --> 00:10:59.870
Thanks!

00:10:59.870 --> 00:11:03.660
I'm Ray Starling. I just
started <i>Dendro</i> yesterday.

00:11:03.660 --> 00:11:07.160
I'm Rook--and I joined up yesterday, too!

00:11:07.160 --> 00:11:11.410
I'm Babi--Babylon! Embryo Type Guardian!

00:11:11.410 --> 00:11:16.790
Hmm. It's not often you see
such a humanoid Guardian.

00:11:16.790 --> 00:11:18.950
Quit staring. It's rude.

00:11:18.950 --> 00:11:22.450
Sorry. She's so rare, I couldn't help myself.

00:11:22.450 --> 00:11:27.200
I'm Nemesis! Embryo Type Maiden-Arms!

00:11:30.080 --> 00:11:34.250
You know, I thought Guardians
were more monster-shaped.

00:11:34.250 --> 00:11:36.450
Well, Babi is a succubus!

00:11:36.450 --> 00:11:42.000
She's sexy and cute and totally drool-worthy!

00:11:38.790 --> 00:11:42.000
Babi! Don't be so obvious--it's embarrassing!

00:11:42.000 --> 00:11:45.000
Rook! Are you ashamed of Babi?

00:11:45.000 --> 00:11:47.620
No, it's not that! I, uh...

00:11:47.620 --> 00:11:53.700
I-I get embarrassed, having my mind read.

00:11:54.830 --> 00:12:00.750
I know! As thanks for your help,
how about we go out for tea?

00:12:00.750 --> 00:12:03.700
Sweets time! I like the sound of that!

00:12:03.700 --> 00:12:07.000
Babi <i>loves</i> sweet treats!

00:12:08.330 --> 00:12:11.000
It's the most delicious time
of year for peaches!

00:12:11.000 --> 00:12:14.750
Can't have sweets without <i>this</i> !

00:12:14.750 --> 00:12:16.870
Hot sauce?

00:12:16.870 --> 00:12:21.750
True to her name, Babylon has
a blasphemous way of eating.

00:12:21.750 --> 00:12:23.870
I have to agree.

00:12:23.870 --> 00:12:25.950
Ten more peach tarts here!

00:12:25.950 --> 00:12:29.000
Although with all that food
Nemesis is putting away...

00:12:29.000 --> 00:12:31.870
Yeah. I know.

00:12:35.370 --> 00:12:38.160
Let's form a party one of these days!

00:12:38.160 --> 00:12:40.450
Yes, please!

00:12:42.000 --> 00:12:43.790
Now, then!

00:12:43.790 --> 00:12:46.370
Time for some serious leveling!

00:12:52.660 --> 00:12:57.950
All right! I'll get up to level 13 today
and move on from this--

00:12:59.290 --> 00:13:02.000
What... What the--?

00:13:02.000 --> 00:13:03.330
Master!

00:13:04.410 --> 00:13:06.450
Counter Absorption!

00:13:09.040 --> 00:13:11.910
A monster? No...

00:13:11.910 --> 00:13:15.000
A monster's name would show up on my HUD.

00:13:15.000 --> 00:13:16.950
Master, this fiend is--

00:13:19.450 --> 00:13:23.540
A monster-shaped Embryo--a Guardian!

00:13:26.910 --> 00:13:29.200
Players, screaming?

00:13:29.200 --> 00:13:31.540
A PK... A player killer!

00:13:31.540 --> 00:13:33.160
Master, retreat!

00:13:34.200 --> 00:13:35.750
First Heal!

00:13:38.250 --> 00:13:42.330
Why are there more victims? The Guardian's dead!

00:13:42.330 --> 00:13:45.500
It must be a Guardian's high-rank
offshoot, Type Legion.

00:13:45.500 --> 00:13:48.540
It can swarm, but individual
units perform poorly.

00:13:48.540 --> 00:13:52.200
That's poor?! This is no joke!

00:13:52.200 --> 00:13:53.080
Master!

00:13:53.080 --> 00:13:55.750
You won't take me down!

00:13:57.200 --> 00:13:59.410
There! Fought it off.

00:14:12.250 --> 00:14:13.620
It's him.

00:14:13.620 --> 00:14:15.370
Master! Run!

00:14:31.120 --> 00:14:33.080
"Fatal Damage | Party Wiped Out"
"Respawn Window Closed |
Penalty for Dying: Login Restricted"

00:14:42.330 --> 00:14:43.700
Dammit!

00:14:54.500 --> 00:14:56.540
Master, you're back.

00:15:00.660 --> 00:15:02.040
Hello again!

00:15:09.160 --> 00:15:11.330
--I'm sorry--
--No.

00:15:11.330 --> 00:15:13.370
I'm the one who should be apologizing.

00:15:13.370 --> 00:15:18.250
If only I'd been stronger--I wouldn't have
lost against another Embryo.

00:15:18.250 --> 00:15:20.540
Now, that's not true.

00:15:20.540 --> 00:15:23.870
If you hadn't shielded me,
I wouldn't have made it that far.

00:15:22.870 --> 00:15:23.870
No!

00:15:23.870 --> 00:15:27.500
I should have been stronger!

00:15:27.500 --> 00:15:29.160
It's terrifying...

00:15:29.160 --> 00:15:34.330
If you hadn't been a player...
you would have been lost forever.

00:15:34.330 --> 00:15:38.200
And that... that scares me to death.

00:15:44.950 --> 00:15:46.790
Nemesis...

00:15:46.790 --> 00:15:49.500
You might be right.

00:15:49.500 --> 00:15:51.000
But you know?

00:15:51.000 --> 00:15:53.750
We were <i>both</i> out of our depths.

00:15:53.750 --> 00:15:54.910
Master...

00:15:54.910 --> 00:15:59.410
But here we are, alive. So we can try again.

00:15:59.410 --> 00:16:03.450
We'll grow stronger together
and have our revenge!

00:16:04.790 --> 00:16:09.660
You really are one clingy guy, you know that?

00:16:09.660 --> 00:16:13.660
But you're right.
There's still a path before us!

00:16:13.660 --> 00:16:17.040
And that Master <i>will</i> pay for what they've done!

00:16:17.040 --> 00:16:19.000
You bet they will!

00:16:19.000 --> 00:16:22.410
Let's go, Master--to get
stronger, ever stronger.

00:16:22.410 --> 00:16:25.700
So that no one will be able
to separate us ever again!

00:16:25.700 --> 00:16:28.790
Yeah! Let's do this, Nemesis!

00:16:28.790 --> 00:16:32.950
This moment here is where we truly begin!

00:16:34.450 --> 00:16:38.700
I said we should get stronger, but why here?

00:16:38.700 --> 00:16:41.750
A bunch of player killers have shown up
near the royal capital all at once.

00:16:41.750 --> 00:16:47.790
The only place they're <i>not</i> is the
Tomb Labyrinth in the royal cemetery.

00:16:47.790 --> 00:16:51.500
But there aren't any other players here, either.

00:16:51.500 --> 00:16:56.910
Probably because you need
a 100-thousand-lir permit to get in.

00:17:01.080 --> 00:17:03.080
Please, enter.

00:17:03.080 --> 00:17:04.410
Eh?

00:17:04.410 --> 00:17:06.750
Don't I need a permit?

00:17:06.750 --> 00:17:09.200
They're not required of Paladins.

00:17:11.450 --> 00:17:14.290
My 100 thousand lir!

00:17:14.290 --> 00:17:17.000
Setting aside those 100 thousand lir for now...

00:17:17.000 --> 00:17:18.290
Shall we?

00:17:18.290 --> 00:17:22.330
Nemesis, could you transform into a sword--?

00:17:19.580 --> 00:17:28.450
I'm not scared, I'm not scared,
I'm not scared, I'm not scared....

00:17:24.540 --> 00:17:28.450
By any chance... are you scared of ghosts?

00:17:30.080 --> 00:17:34.450
Namu Amida abracadabra Elohim
essaim dear Buddha take me now!

00:17:34.450 --> 00:17:36.950
That's beyond mixed-up.

00:17:39.620 --> 00:17:43.290
Huh! It's pretty nice inside.

00:17:43.290 --> 00:17:45.370
Okay, <i>this</i> I can handle.

00:17:45.370 --> 00:17:47.750
Monsters, say your pra--

00:17:50.160 --> 00:17:51.950
No way!

00:17:51.950 --> 00:17:54.540
Hey! Whoa! Calm down!

00:17:54.540 --> 00:17:57.080
You're going to use me to
slice them up, right, Master?

00:17:57.080 --> 00:17:59.450
Of course I am!

00:17:59.450 --> 00:18:01.120
Here I go! Now!

00:18:01.120 --> 00:18:03.870
Eek!

00:18:06.950 --> 00:18:10.000
Sniff, sob... that rotten flesh...

00:18:10.000 --> 00:18:16.790
Sob, sniff... those maggots... Sniff, sob...

00:18:11.290 --> 00:18:13.910
You can stop crying now.

00:18:13.910 --> 00:18:16.790
That got me to level 7!

00:18:19.580 --> 00:18:23.450
I'll give you a nice thorough
polishing when we get back.

00:18:23.450 --> 00:18:25.580
Promise?

00:18:29.370 --> 00:18:31.950
Guess this is all for the first floor.

00:18:31.950 --> 00:18:34.580
Master, someone's coming upstairs.

00:18:38.910 --> 00:18:41.200
--Counter Absorption!
--Counter Absorption!

00:18:52.250 --> 00:18:55.830
Choose, Master: Fight? Or run?

00:18:55.830 --> 00:18:58.700
I can use Counter Absorption one more time.

00:18:58.700 --> 00:19:01.620
If they block that, I'm out of options.

00:19:01.620 --> 00:19:05.250
If I run, they'll go for my back,
and I'll die anyway.

00:19:05.250 --> 00:19:07.200
Which means...

00:19:07.200 --> 00:19:08.580
Are we doing this, Master?

00:19:08.580 --> 00:19:12.830
I'm betting it all on one thing: Blocking their
attack after they show themselves

00:19:12.830 --> 00:19:16.120
and dealing twice the damage
of their second blow!

00:19:36.790 --> 00:19:38.700
Here they come!

00:19:38.700 --> 00:19:39.950
I'm so sorry!

00:19:39.950 --> 00:19:41.500
Huh?

00:19:41.500 --> 00:19:44.540
Wait, what?

00:19:44.540 --> 00:19:47.910
So you mistook me for a monster?

00:19:47.910 --> 00:19:51.620
Mmm-hmm. I really am sorry.

00:19:51.620 --> 00:19:56.700
I suppose seen from below and backlit,
I might look a little monstrous.

00:19:56.700 --> 00:19:57.620
Monstrous?!

00:19:57.620 --> 00:20:01.660
What are you doing on this
high floor solo, anyway?

00:20:01.660 --> 00:20:04.160
Oh, just some grinding.

00:20:04.160 --> 00:20:09.000
Hmm? It must be safer to fight
outdoors if you're still low-level.

00:20:09.000 --> 00:20:10.540
You didn't know?

00:20:10.540 --> 00:20:14.250
There are player killers all around
the royal capital. The area's unusable.

00:20:14.250 --> 00:20:17.290
I've been in here for five days--
I didn't notice.

00:20:17.290 --> 00:20:18.620
Five days?!

00:20:18.620 --> 00:20:20.870
Why have you been in here for so long?

00:20:20.870 --> 00:20:23.700
I went down as far as I could on my own.

00:20:23.700 --> 00:20:26.250
Set a new record this time, too!

00:20:26.250 --> 00:20:28.120
How far did you get?

00:20:28.120 --> 00:20:29.660
Floor 48.

00:20:29.660 --> 00:20:31.200
--On your own?!
--On your own?!

00:20:31.200 --> 00:20:32.750
Who <i>are</i> you?

00:20:32.750 --> 00:20:34.080
Oh!

00:20:34.080 --> 00:20:36.500
I haven't introduced myself.

00:20:36.500 --> 00:20:39.080
The name's Figaro.

00:20:39.080 --> 00:20:41.410
Ah! I'm Ray.

00:20:41.410 --> 00:20:43.080
Pleasure.

00:20:42.000 --> 00:20:44.290
This is my Embryo, Nemesis.

00:20:44.290 --> 00:20:48.370
Wait-- <i>that</i> top-ranking Figaro?

00:20:48.370 --> 00:20:50.000
Mmm-hmm. The same.

00:20:50.000 --> 00:20:52.790
Why would someone like that
be in a place like this?

00:20:52.790 --> 00:20:56.450
I like this labyrinth--and arenas, too.

00:20:56.450 --> 00:20:57.750
Arenas?

00:20:57.750 --> 00:21:01.080
The kingdom has some in Gideon, the Duel City.

00:21:01.080 --> 00:21:05.160
You can die in an arena without
actually dying. You should try!

00:21:05.160 --> 00:21:06.830
Oh... huh.

00:21:06.830 --> 00:21:10.700
Gideon's right over the southern mountains, so--

00:21:10.700 --> 00:21:14.500
Oh. I guess maps are locked right now.

00:21:14.500 --> 00:21:19.790
But passage to and from Gideon
has been cut off... What a bother.

00:21:19.790 --> 00:21:24.200
Well, I'll figure something out.
By way of apology for earlier.

00:21:24.200 --> 00:21:27.330
The outside should be usable tomorrow.

00:21:27.330 --> 00:21:30.120
Get those levels up and come to Gideon.

00:21:30.120 --> 00:21:31.410
Right! I will!

00:21:31.410 --> 00:21:33.790
But you know, you two are good.

00:21:33.790 --> 00:21:34.580
Huh?

00:21:34.580 --> 00:21:37.370
You took my blow without it breaking you.

00:21:37.370 --> 00:21:41.660
I like you! I wouldn't mind an arena
bout with you before too long.

00:21:41.660 --> 00:21:43.120
Same here!

00:21:43.120 --> 00:21:44.790
We've got us a deal!

00:21:46.160 --> 00:21:49.580
All right! I'm going to grind
my levels up like crazy today!

00:21:49.580 --> 00:21:51.290
Bring it on!

00:21:52.450 --> 00:21:55.120
Sniff, sob, sob...

00:21:55.120 --> 00:21:56.830
Sob, sniff...

00:21:56.830 --> 00:22:01.660
I can feel more of their flesh
stuck on me down there...

00:22:01.660 --> 00:22:04.200
Sniff, sob...

00:22:01.660 --> 00:22:04.200
Oh, uh... got it.

00:22:04.200 --> 00:22:05.290
Sob, sniff...

00:22:05.290 --> 00:22:06.830
More flesh... right there...

00:22:06.830 --> 00:22:09.040
Yep... got it.

00:22:07.830 --> 00:22:09.040
Sniff, sob...

00:22:09.040 --> 00:22:12.700
And there, too... Sob, sniff...

00:23:43.910 --> 00:23:48.370
"Superior"

00:23:45.500 --> 00:23:47.000
"Superior."
